{"candidate_identity":"6f21ef18f0f4ef14717392c8ca72e7d6a7cf26d850ab668bc168354317e0db14","payload":{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"466f2963d4bff8acf5cc282c7add1516a6215b14013f2b5887f22992118b0849","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"e7f6cac45636258afab312140a86a32d7c4cd9b27f13ea612747f59796920e49","logical_entry_identity":"93c3fde0ac0e6feff3295d6e7d5e361493d052b9f135a765a3a95fc2e91f38e8","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Launch yourself toward a target. If the target is reached you get a free attack doing %d%% weapon damage.\n\t\tIf the attack hits you release a massive burst of fire in radius %d, knocking away all enemies except your target and dealing %d damage.\n\t\tYou must charge from at least 2 tiles away.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"向目标冲锋，如果到达目标位置，则攻击目标造成 %d%% 武器伤害。\n\t\t若攻击命中，将释放半径 3 码的强烈火焰冲击，将目标以外的所有敌对生物击退 %d 码，并对范围内的敌人（包括目标）造成 %d 点火焰伤害。\n\t\t至少要从 2 码外开始冲锋。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b9a957431ae38c14de2c0fc56ef9c8becf57158587be07e8915d8eca086c7d64","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"e847bf0754a9c27651b2e6d128c42de2753ca38721920cdf6fbccf22d0da168b","logical_entry_identity":"87f515afd07ac61af1c73b28e3d98a01664d20cbcdff2bcf20c6b914f25f0123","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"wretch titan","source_tag":"entity name","target":"腐化泰坦"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3db6e1ccaac0744fb1084e90a5f54c5d5ac2e28a639308e9aff04f027a24a3c2","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"e87c7158c6c172b8cfc45a5adbe1ae1ecbcdb76808baf005fed2f8a5492962a2","logical_entry_identity":"87ae86c131c1aa3486a3c6b78c98cb0e87d5c542e1c38b87a429e21b5c680653","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"demon statue: wretch titan","source_tag":"_t","target":"恶魔雕像：腐化泰坦"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bff3011363516d9c907b3e54fea64f06e5a3bc10a1bc728a75fa1be9c51b499f","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"e8b56851f137662867a0e4cf29385b5a4320eb10097c17866f156546120147d6","logical_entry_identity":"59cc528297518946d62ed21778af94403bd9dd666c749b0bfa8eced196180a62","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Plaguefire detonates when its victim dies, spreading to other enemies up to two times.","source_tag":"_t","target":"疫火感染的生物死亡时，疫火将传播到附近的敌人。至多传播2次。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cc168ed7a4e8247571485fd35dcd807e1df8343d4ab0bb781e85bf4b709117d6","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"e8ebbad4625358eee2e41bcde438ee3d34415b244a5dc13514411ed48eda0ccd","logical_entry_identity":"b70e7e83dcc7c149591f9d78c982566afaf51ddf81a253422adae816dfac5f1f","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"cold","source_tag":"effect subtype","target":"寒冷"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"be0757f7b3ddb8a16a6d48b592a54cc7652a051b1e3ce66bfccfff08439ffa5b","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"e983810c8cf9bb078525284781ccc9705bc260ce9f0c3209485bd91c19f464d0","logical_entry_identity":"cdc31236d5fd9be39f76edc849a5978e68a682e4628a07fb81b25fcb43293489","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Behold, the humble wretchling, a testament to our devotion to our Father!  These children of emerald were among the first to alter themselves for our quest for vengeance, and managed an astounding degree of success.  With their bursts of blinding speed, overwhelming numbers, and skin that can release prodigious amounts of corrosive fluid, wretchlings can storm onto the battlefield and pounce on our foes one-by-one, dissolving the ground they walk on while leaving them helpless against our onslaught.  Wretchlings will readily give their lives in combat, serving as obstructions and shields while their acid and our casters do their work, and still remain the most populous of our species thanks to their incredible birth rates.  It is rare to see a wretchling survive to maturity, but make no mistake - every wretchling that fights does an incredible service to our cause.","source_tag":"_t","target":"看着他，谦逊的酸液树魔，这是我们对父亲奉献一切的证明！这些绿翡翠的孩子们第一批同意改变自身以帮助复仇，同时取得了惊人的成功。极快的速度、庞大的数目以及能释放大量酸液的皮肤，酸液树魔能旋风般猛冲入战场，一个个扑住敌人，溶解土地，将无助的敌人暴露在我们的杀戮前。酸液树魔时刻准备着，怀着大无畏的牺牲精神，以肉体充当屏障，令酸液和法术能够发挥作用。尽管如此，在他们惊人的繁殖率下，他们仍是我们中数目最多的种族。我们很难见到一只酸液树魔活到成熟期，但请记住——每一只战斗过的酸液树魔都为我们的目标奉献了一切。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1bbaf0001fd50286407af045f6bc749351e142a7c7903ddf992ca1f0f5f37525","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"ea1d8fcb0b64e634030eb0c5fe37dbc85d0f8399d01079b3d2601a3b6ac52a17","logical_entry_identity":"aabcd1bb7bf93addd078d24a7153d501d3ac9697ce18b291c7164d20d6e504b6","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Strike a blow with your weapon for %d%% blight damage.\n\t\tIf the attack hits a demonic seed tries to take hold inside your foe and you follow up with a shield strike dealing %d%% damage and dazing your target for %d turns.\n\t\t\n\t\tThe seed requires a powerful host to nourish it and can only take hold in creatures that are worth experience and that are not summoned demons.\n\t\tThe chance for the seed to take hold is based on the creatures rank:\n\t\t%sNormal#LAST#:  5%%\n\t\t%sElite#LAST#:  20%%\n\t\t%sRare#LAST# or %sUnique#LAST#:  50%%\n\t\t%sBoss#LAST#:  100%%\n\t\tWhen the host dies the seed fills with the vim of the dying creature and turns into a specific demon seed that can be used to summon that demon.\n\t\tIf you already have a seed of the same time in your inventory or equipment it will instead increase its level if the host was of higher level than the seed and the demon inside will regenerate %d%% health and resurrect if it was dead.\n\n\t\tHigher talent levels allow for more powerful demon types.\n\t\tImplanting a seed into unique demons, if successful, will always try to grant a seed of that type, if available.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"对目标造成 %d%% 枯萎武器伤害。\n\t\t如果攻击命中，你会将恶魔种子植入目标体内，然后用盾牌攻击目标，造成 %d%% 盾牌伤害并眩晕 敌人 %d 回合。\n\n\t\t种子需要足够强大的宿主来成长，它只能寄生在值得获取经验值的生物体内，不能寄生在被召唤的恶魔体内。\n\t\t种子的存活几率基于宿主的级别：\n\t\t%s普通生物#LAST#:5%%\n\t\t%s精英生物#LAST#:20%%\n\t\t%s稀有#LAST#与%s史诗生物#LAST#:50%%\n\t\t%sBoss#LAST#:100%%\n\t\t当宿主死亡时，种子将吸收宿主的活力，成长为一个特定的恶魔种子，能用于召唤恶魔。\n\t\t如果你的背包或装备上已经有了同类的恶魔种子，且宿主等级高于恶魔的等级，它会提升种子的等级。此外，里面的恶魔会恢复 %d%% 生命值，如果已死则会被复活。\n\n\t\t高技能等级将带来更强大的种子。\n\t\t如果成功将种子植入史诗生物（Unique）的体内，且它有对应的恶魔种子的话，你必定会获得该恶魔种子。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4f4733620913b475e606eea46092cf17d7581bf54a324852b0fa44aa374c5067","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"ea666058480c566579c867ef5e867e789fad24622a21397204dc7a0307eec43b","logical_entry_identity":"783de8fcb13672c7079dc387a9e02c202ac38dcbcdb1ce10f5dd5d1cfda5d26f","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"tooth lined belt","source_tag":"_t","target":"布满尖齿的腰带"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c3959bc073615d97312126896da520ead1c9ba0860ddb91a6fcbd0d9308329f3","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"ea876cf7d24434f79f12b9159c048815baa635dfeaa4b015ef06f7c24a137652","logical_entry_identity":"84786b574b2c658bb1ede547949151698bd237eab8ad2509f0dfecaa8ff82393","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Fiery Aegis","source_tag":"_t","target":"火焰守护"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"346ac2fce8e03c5715211edd1c257b47929966b4210129aba1ba8055bfd77577","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"ea94ce9c017e8927b5cede8e32b2b063814f550f0688255322d639cc6dc2d29c","logical_entry_identity":"f34a94c1755d4eae0e2a9650d16a09b81803bf6b9730a6cce0bec6ad4a42e4e0","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"#{italic}#This plaque is mostly covered in shifting shadows.  You can only make out a little bit of the text.#{normal}#\n\n#927e64#~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~#LAST#heregs are not the only way we recycle #927e64#~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~#LAST#arness their fear and suspici#927e64#~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~#LAST#outs.  Cautious and yet sadistic, these assassins #927e64#~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~ ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~#LAST#markably effective in indirect combat, setting ambus#927e64#~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~#LAST#justice.  Additionally, the shadows they produce #927e64#~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~#LAST#spionage, scouting, and #927e64#~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~#LAST#king them a val#927e64#~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~#LAST#tion to our intel-gathering camps. Redee#927e64#~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~#LAST# data they contribute on#927e64#~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~#LAST# paving the way for our invasion.\n\n#{italic}#As you reach the end, the text goes completely black, and a new message forms.#{normal}#\n\n#{bold}#WE SEE YOU.#{normal}#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{italic}#上面的文字被浮动的阴影所笼罩，你只能依稀看到模糊的文字碎片#{normal}#\n\n#927e64#～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～~#LAST#希瑞格并不是我们回收#927e64#～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～#LAST#卸下他们的恐惧和怀#927e64#～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～#LAST#。他们已经变得谨慎，然而仍然足够施虐成性，这些暗夜的杀手#927e64#～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～~ ～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～#LAST#他们卓越的表现在非直接战斗，尤其是发动突#927e64#～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～#LAST#义。另外，他们制造的黑暗之雾#927e64#～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～~#LAST#间谍活动，侦察活动，以及#927e64#～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～~#LAST#给他们一个#927e64#～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～#LAST#息提供给了我们的情报机构。为了偿#927e64#～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～~#LAST#他们提供的数据被用#927e64#～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～~#LAST#为我们最终的侵略铺平了道路。\n\n#{italic}#当你看到最后，上面的文字一下子笼罩在完全的黑暗之中，一行新的消息浮现出来#{normal}#\n\n#{bold}#我们正看着你。#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c195102acda27adb4bca6ee10da142d9e1c70da50e8e80beb2548dde11dc6f75","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"eabdf2417bc068f433a9b368bd0be5aebd1680b1d601e89d0c30d06b9acb7492","logical_entry_identity":"d4c9ec982337da77cb86548034444a2df118789fa7a04beb3558912e267f6141","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"history of Mal'Rok (3)","source_tag":"_t","target":"玛·洛克的历史（3）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"94903df474aced19f5f232fc8536022970569e6851f9a206e08310a141d1192d","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"eac7f7169788a3742616ca69926536bab8ac1e53c3bc268cf852c94d2788dbd7","logical_entry_identity":"92bcc3e918579292dbc4c7fed1637598b2ab142c8c34a392fc4d7c16d2d5eba5","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Increases all damage penetration by 1% for each point of your Shadow Power.","source_tag":"_t","target":"每点“阴影强度”增加1%抗性穿透。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6c33e9ec6d83127866e831da8fd6f0de524af2f5907a428913638676af32981f","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"eb3798aa5cc09f733ed215b53f92fd02dd145ef52ec9c1a00d2d7a4550ad7514","logical_entry_identity":"17ea760cdf02087d1fa687b79c9ef91c4e71bb8b27959eec41fd2f5bddb3a37c","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"shifting breastplate","source_tag":"_t","target":"不断变形的胸甲"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bcd95c3cf07d38da3db378a1f52410cac4fe0f7d88e18963a1430b52c05a4cf1","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"eb38d586e7308527eab2644743dd5081bbedbf1c593abb263f93973f0eca7d60","logical_entry_identity":"8dcb9451454953e01f645e6d93786712bb55143ac54e79ab9bb8aac70adbfb